                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "for the most part",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                        "entry_id": "25a6b36f-0a88-36ac-9ec9-7dd3c2369ef8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In most aspects; mostly; generally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29ba8bc7-c406-4e1e-b59b-d29a47d7a4cf",
                                                "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                                "text": "For the most part, the crowd was orderly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b072f81e-e4a0-4821-8508-5158a9691f55",
                                                "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                                "text": "The sky is overcast for the most part."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e9e9f60-4039-405d-8ea2-677e1b90b6df",
                                                "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                                "text": "Until the 1600s, English was, for the most part, spoken in England."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4090b4b8-f56c-4b01-9f81-0762a72b38a0",
                                                "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                                "text": "O, it offends mee to the Soule, to ſee a robuſtious Pery-wig-pated Fellow, teare a Paſſion to tatters, to verie ragges, to ſplit the eares of the Groundlings: who (for the moſt part) are capeable of nothing, but inexplicable dumbe ſhewes, & noiſe:[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7aa23865-2f9e-4f4e-8891-9d390324a39c",
                                                "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                                "text": "Such souls can with assistance rise to better things, but it is a very arduous task and for the most part they remain rejoicers in evil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6be70a0d-d189-48fa-ac79-6a9860a2f5df",
                                                "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                                "text": "For the most part they were small standard gauge 0-6-0 side tanks of the type illustrated, with long tapered chimneys and an unusual feature for the Continent in the shape of domeless boilers, the protuberance just behind the chimney being a sandbox."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26a9e8dc-4abc-483b-b671-afebfe96b8de",
                                                "sense_id": "ca32d96d-17f0-39fb-a84c-89b7ad243a49",
                                                "text": "With half-time approaching, England rather switched off, but for the most part it was an improved first 40 minutes from Johnson's side, which came in for much criticism following stuttering displays in their first two games."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cacafee8-b1f1-4b19-9bb7-4f9c7528b50d",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5fd28f1-73b5-392f-8b5a-07ecb1c8f6d5",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f85f0b7-6f4a-3532-b5cb-9d9fee9dc6f6",
                        "source_sense_description": "voor het grootste gedeelte",
                        "target_lang_word": "mostly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mostly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0cebb0f-dbc8-3638-a21e-c968c28a65de",
                                        "entry_id": "180889e0-8b8e-3c59-bad3-08cb8576e1d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mainly or chiefly; for the most part; usually, generally, on the whole."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a0cf8b2-7763-4b3a-b2c2-0eec418282ec",
                                                "sense_id": "d0cebb0f-dbc8-3638-a21e-c968c28a65de",
                                                "text": "They're mostly good people, although they have made a few mistakes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66b235a1-9d25-4066-aeea-c21830c9f561",
                                                "sense_id": "d0cebb0f-dbc8-3638-a21e-c968c28a65de",
                                                "text": "Mostly, the microbiome is beneficial. It helps with digestion and enables people to extract a lot more calories from their food than would otherwise be possible. Research over the past few years, however, has implicated it in diseases from atherosclerosis to asthma to autism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0873a558-85fc-3955-b66d-8975920204cc",
                                        "entry_id": "180889e0-8b8e-3c59-bad3-08cb8576e1d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To the greatest extent; most."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "592497f3-755c-4c8b-9c68-6a86e275c4d8",
                                                "sense_id": "0873a558-85fc-3955-b66d-8975920204cc",
                                                "text": "She was to be their chosen visitor, she was to be for weeks under the same roof with the person whose society she mostly prized [...]!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aaf3cd3f-7855-4f43-ae01-915f86ffda97",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5fd28f1-73b5-392f-8b5a-07ecb1c8f6d5",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f85f0b7-6f4a-3532-b5cb-9d9fee9dc6f6",
